---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="AI API Cost Optimization Handbook — Not Yet Available"
  description="The AI API Cost Optimization Handbook is in preparation and is not currently available for purchase. Use the free cost calculator."
  canonical="https://aicost.apexcraftweb.com/handbook">
  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 text-center">
    <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-purple-700 mb-4">Not available for purchase</p>
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6">AI API Cost Optimization Handbook</h1>
    <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 mb-4">This handbook is in preparation. There is no checkout, delivery date, or savings guarantee.</p>
    <p class="text-slate-600 mb-8">You can use the free calculator to explore estimated costs. Confirm current rates and model availability with the provider before making a decision.</p>
    <a href="/" class="inline-flex bg-purple-600 hover:bg-purple-700 text-white font-semibold px-6 py-3 rounded-xl">Use the Free Calculator →</a>
  </section>
</Layout>
